.DS_Store
build
xcuserdata
xcshareddata
.idea

# ...but keep KeyCastr's own shared schemes in version control. The blanket
# "xcshareddata" rule above is why this project had no committed scheme, which in turn is
# why KCVisualizerTests had no test action and silently never ran. Each parent directory has
# to be re-included explicitly before the file can be: git will not descend into a directory
# excluded by an earlier pattern, so a negation for the file alone would have no effect.
!keycastr/KeyCastr.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!keycastr/KeyCastr.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/
!keycastr/KeyCastr.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/*.xcscheme
